  "content": "\n\n<p>這個資源包將破壞動畫改為<span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">c</span><span style=\"color:#00f\">o<span style=\"color:#800080\">l</span></span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">o</span><span style=\"color:#f60\">r</span><span style=\"color:#f00\">f</span><span style=\"color:#fc0\">u</span><span style=\"color:#0f0\">l</span></strong></span>，您可以在圖片中查看。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>歡迎瀏覽我的新作品 :)</strong><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/food-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/794628/description_fde6fe86-59c2-4aa8-9f18-1c80421deb56.png\" alt=\"Food Additions 模組 (1.20.1 與 1.18.2)\" width=\"768\" height=\"432\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#930\">Optifine</span> 並非必要安裝項目</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您可以在整合包中使用此資源包，但您</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>絕對不能將其宣稱是自己的作品！！！</strong> </span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>遇到任何 Bug 請務必回報給我！！！</strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>我的其他實用作品：</strong></p>\n<p>資源包：<strong>No Animations</strong>（提升 FPS，適合效能較低的電腦）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/no-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/no-animations</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Clear Lava and Water</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clear-water-and-lava\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clear-water-and-lava</a></p>\n<p>模組：<strong>Shatr</strong>（加入大量有趣內容，適用於 1.16.5）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shatr\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shatr</a></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
